            "text": "<p><strong>Why Peanut Butter Dog Treats Are a Great Choice for Your Pet</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Urc8Hy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cats are natural explorers. They love darting into bags, hiding under beds, and popping out from unexpected places. A cat tunnel taps directly into that instinct—creating a safe, stimulating environment that encourages play, exercise, and relaxation. If your cat is bored, anxious, or simply loves to play chase, a tunnel is one of the best ways to enrich their life indoors.</p><p>The Snarky Pets Cat Tunnel is built to deliver that fun every day. With a collapsible frame, roomy 12-inch diameter, mesh peek windows, crinkle textures, and playful neon leaf accents, it keeps cats curious and active. Unlike flimsy tunnels that flatten after a few uses, this one holds its shape, folds flat for storage, and stands up to claws and zoomies. Below, I’ll share why tunnels matter, what sets this one apart, and how to get the most out of it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
