        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_KaQxnw": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_rXpewP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What Makes the Snarky Pets Cat Tunnel Different</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most tunnels are made with thin fabric, narrow openings, and little thought for longevity. Here’s why this one stands out:</p><ul><li><br/><strong>Roomy size</strong>: At around 72 inches long and 12 inches wide, it fits everything from kittens to “chonky” cats.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Interactive design</strong>: Neon green leaf accents and a bell ball toy keep cats visually and physically engaged.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Peekaboo mesh windows</strong>: Cats can watch from inside or pop out mid-chase.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Durable & safe materials</strong>: Built to withstand daily clawing and rough play.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Collapsible storage</strong>: Folds flat when not in use, making it easy to stash away.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
