        "text_cE7LyU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Vs. SmartyKat Crackle Chute</strong>: While fun, it’s only 9.5 inches wide—too small for larger cats. The Snarky Pets tunnel is wider and sturdier.</p><p><br/><strong>Vs. PAWZ Road Tunnels</strong>: These offer fun shapes but use softer fabrics that wear quickly. Snarky Pets uses reinforced seams and scratch-friendly material.<br/><br/><strong>Vs. Catry Camino Tunnel</strong>: Aesthetic but less interactive. Snarky Pets balances durability and engagement with crinkle sounds and bright accents.</p>"
