          }
        },
        "text_efUHYw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Placement matters</strong>: Set it near windows, cat trees, or favorite play areas.<br/><strong>Mix it up</strong>: Rotate locations weekly to keep curiosity high.<br/><strong>Add extras</strong>: Drop a toy ball inside or dangle a teaser at the opening.<br/><strong>Pair with treats</strong>: Toss in a few crunchy snacks to build positive associations.<br/><strong>Supervised outdoor fun</strong>: Use it on patios or balconies (never unsupervised).</p>"
