          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Why Choose Snarky Pets</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_LyNe3c": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Snarky Pets focuses on products that are practical for humans and irresistible for cats. Their tunnel reflects this: stylish black-and-gray fabric, playful accents, and thoughtful durability. It’s a perfect match for pet parents who want enrichment without compromising aesthetics.<br/><br/></p>"
