            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_G6zn6q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Will the tunnel work for large cats?</strong><br/>Yes—at 12 inches wide, it accommodates bigger breeds and even multiple cats at once.</p><p><strong>2. How do I get my cat interested?</strong><br/>Start with toys, treats, or catnip inside. Use a teaser wand to lure your cat through—the crinkle sound will spark curiosity.</p><p><strong>3. Can it be used outdoors?</strong><br/>It’s designed for indoor use but can be used on flat, shaded patios with supervision. Always fold it away after outdoor play to extend its life.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
